#: ../../source/deployment-guide/postgres-migration-assist-tool.rst:196
msgid ""
"``migration-assist mysql`` — Checks MySQL schema readiness and offers "
"fixes."
msgstr ""
"``migration-assist mysql`` — MySQL 스키마 준비 상태를 확인하고 수정 사항을 "
"제안합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/postgres-migration-assist-tool.rst:197
msgid ""
"``migration-assist postgres`` — Builds the PostgreSQL schema and applies "
"migrations."
msgstr ""
"``migration-assist postgres`` — PostgreSQL 스키마를 빌드하고 마이그레이션을 "
"적용합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/postgres-migration-assist-tool.rst:198
msgid ""
"``migration-assist pgloader`` — Generates a pgloader config for data "
"transfer."
msgstr ""
"``migration-assist pgloader`` — 데이터 전송을 위한 pgloader 구성을 "
"생성합니다."

